    LLM: "Try to play your highest pip tiles early. Start your train as soon as possible. Play on the Mexican Train when you don't have plays for your own train.\n\nManage your doubles carefully - they can help you control the game but require immediate attention. Force opponents to mark their trains by controlling available plays.\n\nTrack which tiles have been played to predict opponents' holdings. Use doubles strategically to force opponents to draw. Time your plays to leave yourself with exit options.",
